    "Every expectation in this file was written by hand against the P5.3 contract, not produced by running the renderer. A case says what the contract must answer; the test then holds the implementation to it.",
    "The accepted evidence is the frozen fixtures/ corpus: the scanner document from hrca.scanner.scan_directory and the Twin store from hrca.twin.build_store over it. A case never re-derives its own expected output from the implementation; it names the exact identities it expects to be bound.",
